<%# 전교 통합 통계(P7.5). 전 학교 참여율·5축 평균 + 전국 랭킹 원자료. %>
<div class="space-y-6">
  <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
    <h1 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">전교 통합 통계</h1>
    <%= link_to "전교 CSV 내보내기", admin_analytics_export_path(format: :csv),
          class: "rounded-lg bg-gray-800 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white" %>
  </div>

  <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3">
    <div class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-4">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">전체 학생</p>
      <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900"><%= @total_students %></p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-4">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">전체 독후감</p>
      <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900"><%= @total_reports %></p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-4">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">승인(검토완료)</p>
      <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900"><%= @approved_count %></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-4">
    <h2 class="mb-3 text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">학교별 통계</h2>
    <div class="overflow-x-auto">
      <table class="w-full text-left text-sm">
        <thead class="border-b border-gray-200 text-gray-500">
          <tr>
            <th class="py-2 pr-4">학교</th>
            <th class="py-2 pr-4">학생수</th>
            <th class="py-2 pr-4">독후감수</th>
            <th class="py-2 pr-4">참여율(%)</th>
            <% ReadingDomain::RUBRIC_AXES.each do |axis| %>
              <th class="py-2 pr-4"><%= ReadingDomain::AXIS_LABELS[axis] %></th>
            <% end %>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <% @school_stats.each do |stat| %>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="py-2 pr-4 font-medium text-gray-900"><%= stat[:school].name %></td>
              <td class="py-2 pr-4"><%= stat[:student_count] %></td>
              <td class="py-2 pr-4"><%= stat[:report_count] %></td>
              <td class="py-2 pr-4"><%= stat[:participation] %></td>
              <% ReadingDomain::RUBRIC_AXES.each do |axis| %>
                <td class="py-2 pr-4"><%= stat[:axis_averages][axis] %></td>
              <% end %>
            </tr>
          <% end %>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-4">
    <h2 class="mb-3 text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">전국 랭킹 원자료 (포인트 상위)</h2>
    <% if @ranking.empty? %>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">아직 랭킹 데이터가 없어요.</p>
    <% else %>
      <ol class="space-y-1 text-sm">
        <% @ranking.each_with_index do |user, index| %>
          <li class="flex justify-between">
            <span><%= index + 1 %>. <%= user.name %> (<%= user.school&.name %>)</span>
            <span class="font-medium"><%= user.points %>P</span>
          </li>
        <% end %>
      </ol>
    <% end %>
  </section>
</div>
